@startuml
title D17 - Sequence tạo và duyệt doanh nghiệp (as-built)
autonumber

actor "Business User" as User
actor Admin
participant "React SPA" as Web
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Bearer-token Middleware" as Auth
participant "Auth Service" as AuthService
participant "Company Service" as CompanyService
database "company_db" as CompanyDB
database "auth_db" as AuthDB

User -> Web : Nhập hồ sơ doanh nghiệp
Web -> Gateway : POST /api/companies + bearer token
Gateway -> Auth : Xác thực token
Auth -> AuthService : VerifyToken/GetUserByEmail(gRPC)
AuthService -> AuthDB : SELECT User
AuthDB --> AuthService : User
AuthService --> Auth : user_id, role
Auth --> Gateway : user_id
Gateway -> CompanyService : CreateCompany(gRPC)
CompanyService -> CompanyDB : INSERT Company(status=pending)
CompanyDB --> CompanyService : company_id
CompanyService --> Gateway : Company
Gateway --> Web : HTTP 200 + Company(pending)
Web --> User : Hiển thị chờ duyệt

== Admin phê duyệt ==
Admin -> Web : Chọn phê duyệt
Web -> Gateway : POST /api/companies/{id}/approve
Gateway -> Auth : Xác thực + AdminOnly
Auth --> Gateway : role=admin
Gateway -> CompanyService : ApproveCompany(gRPC)
CompanyService -> CompanyDB : UPDATE status=verified
CompanyDB --> CompanyService : OK
CompanyService --> Gateway : Company(verified)
Gateway --> Web : HTTP 200
Web --> Admin : Duyệt thành công

note over Gateway,CompanyService
  Gateway chỉ orchestration REST/gRPC.
  SQL nằm trong repository của từng service.
end note
@enduml
